meta {
  name: Insert No Token
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "skuCode": "sem-token-{{$randomInt}}",
    "quantity": 1
  }
}

docs {
  No Authorization header at all.

  Expected depends on environment — same known gap as
  product-service-errors/Create Product No Token.bru (see CLAUDE.md's "Limitações de
  segurança conhecidas"):
  - "Gateway" (:8080): 401 UNAUTHORIZED, {"error": "Token não fornecido"}.
  - "InventoryDirect" (:8083): 201 CREATED — inventory-service has no Spring Security
    dependency at all, so the write goes through unauthenticated.
}
